@startuml
title System Architecture - s000091_f459979d

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "Authenticated API Client" as ApiClient
component "LwM2M Service Component" as Lwm2mService
component "Ethereum-compatible Node" as EthereumNode
component "Smart Contract\nClient/Bootstrap Storage" as SmartContract
database "Blockchain-backed\nClient/Bootstrap Storage" as BlockchainStorage

interface "User HTTP API" as UserHttpApi
interface "Blockchain Client/Bootstrap\nInterface" as BlockchainApi
interface "Ethereum Connectivity\n(Web3j HTTP transport)" as EthereumApi
interface "LwM2M Node\nDeserialization Interface" as Lwm2mApi

package "Backend Runtime (Java / Spring)" as Backend {
  component "User HTTP API\n(Spring Controller)" as UserApi
  component "JWT Token Validation\n(JwtUtility.isValidToken(auth, 1))" as Jwt
  component "User Service" as UserService

  package "Blockchain Integration" {
    component "Client/Security\nInformation Service" as SecurityInfoService
    component "Client Bootstrap\nService" as BootstrapService
    component "Blockchain Contract Client\n(Web3j)" as ContractClient
    component "32-byte ASCII Codec" as AsciiCodec
  }

  package "LwM2M Integration" {
    component "LwM2M Node JSON\nDeserializer" as NodeJsonDeserializer
    component "LwM2M Model Types\n(Leshan node/resource structures)" as Lwm2mModel
  }
}

ApiClient --> UserHttpApi : GET users / POST /add\nAuthorization header
UserHttpApi -- UserApi
UserApi --> Jwt : validate token
Jwt --> UserApi : validation result\n0 / 1 / 2 / other
UserApi --> UserService : retrieve users\nor add user
UserService --> UserApi : user list\nor created user

SecurityInfoService --> ContractClient : retrieve all clients
ContractClient --> BlockchainApi : contract operations
SmartContract -- BlockchainApi
ContractClient --> EthereumApi
EthereumNode -- EthereumApi
SmartContract --> BlockchainStorage : read/write client/bootstrap data

BootstrapService --> AsciiCodec : encode string fields\nto fixed 32-byte ASCII
AsciiCodec --> BootstrapService : decode fixed 32-byte\nfields to ASCII strings
BootstrapService --> ContractClient : add client /\nget client by endpoint
ContractClient --> SmartContract : retrieveAllClients()\naddClient(...)\ngetClient(endpoint)

Lwm2mService --> BootstrapService : request bootstrap\nconfiguration by endpoint
BootstrapService --> Lwm2mService : bootstrap configuration
Lwm2mService --> Lwm2mApi : LwM2M node JSON
Lwm2mApi -- NodeJsonDeserializer
NodeJsonDeserializer --> Lwm2mModel : typed node/resource\nstructures
Lwm2mModel --> Lwm2mService : typed LwM2M nodes

note right of UserApi
  Access control:
  200 OK / 201 Created - valid token
  401 Unauthorized - validation result 1
  403 Forbidden - validation result 2
  400 Bad Request - other invalid results
end note

note bottom of SecurityInfoService
  On contract-access failure:
  record exception and return an
  empty collection without propagating
end note

note bottom of AsciiCodec
  Fixed 32-byte ASCII-compatible
  encoding on submission and ASCII
  decoding on retrieval (NFR-004)
end note

note bottom of NodeJsonDeserializer
  Valid JSON -> typed LwM2M node structures.
  Invalid payloads, including instances
  without required id, cause parsing failure.
  Primitive mapping:
  boolean->BOOLEAN, string->STRING,
  lossless number->INTEGER, other number->FLOAT,
  default->STRING.
end note

note bottom of SmartContract
  Client/bootstrap fields:
  endpoint, bootstrap server URL/identity/key,
  server URL/identity/key
end note

@enduml
